  "worked_solution": "Recall that\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(\\operatorname{cosh}\u2061x)=\\operatorname{sinh}\u2061x\\, & \u21d2\\,\\int \\operatorname{sinh}\u2061x\\,\\text{d}x=\\operatorname{cosh}\u2061x+C, \\\\ \\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(\\operatorname{sech}\u2061x)=-\\operatorname{sech}\u2061x\\operatorname{tanh}\u2061x\\, & \u21d2\\,\\int \\operatorname{sech}\u2061x\\operatorname{tanh}\u2061x\\,\\text{d}x=-\\operatorname{sech}\u2061x+C.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\int (2\\operatorname{sinh}\u2061x-\\operatorname{sech}\u2061x\\operatorname{tanh}\u2061x)\\text{d}x & =\\int 2\\operatorname{sinh}\u2061x\\,\\text{d}x+\\int (-\\operatorname{sech}\u2061x\\operatorname{tanh}\u2061x)\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =2\\int \\operatorname{sinh}\u2061x\\,\\text{d}x-\\int \\operatorname{sech}\u2061x\\operatorname{tanh}\u2061x\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =2\\operatorname{cosh}\u2061x-(-\\operatorname{sech}\u2061x)+C \\\\  & =2\\operatorname{cosh}\u2061x+\\operatorname{sech}\u2061x+C.\\end{aligned}\n$$",
